     81  2eb5							; Every Game Boy / NES voice lets go now (no soft releases), so nothing
     82  2eb5							; sounding depends on the old sound's octave or bass settings. The next
     83  2eb5							; voice update plays the held notes again.
     84  2eb5				   SoundRelease
     85  2eb5					      subroutine
     86  2eb5		       a9 01		      lda	#1
     87  2eb7		       8d cb c3 	      sta	hardCut
     88  2eba		       a2 00		      ldx	#0
     89  2ebc				   .v
